    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. It sounds like a lot of these new policies are basically just a way for countries to pull back from globalism. But do you think this move toward \"industrial independence\" is actually a smart long-term strategy for most nations, or is it just a regressive way to deal with economic problems?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
